      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Targeting Criteria Facet URNs",
      "Anchor": "targeting-criteria-facet-urns",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "LinkedIn uses member facets to define a segment of members who will be either included or excluded from an advertising campaign\u0027s targeting. targetingCriteria provides a generic AND / OR construct to include and exclude different targeting facets when defining audience for campaigns. targetingCriteria can be attached to a campaign just like \u00A0previous targeting object.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Targeting Criteria Facet URNs",
      "Anchor": "targeting-criteria-facet-urns",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The table below provides a list of adTargetingFacets that can be used in the targetingCriteria",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Targeting Criteria Facet URNs",
      "Anchor": "targeting-criteria-facet-urns",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Note",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
