      "Section": "Targeting Criteria Facet URNs",
      "Anchor": "targeting-criteria-facet-urns",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "These facets names and facet values mentioned below are discoverable using the adTargetingFacets and adTargetingEntities API.",
